<RTL>(2025) UL Standard for Safety Molded-Case Circuit Breakers, Molded-Case Switches and Circuit-Breaker Enclosures</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF></SPT><SPT><TTL>SUMMARY</TTL><BRK/>
