<BRK/>
<TXT>Submit a list of <SUB>spare parts</SUB> as specified herin.  Provide spare parts that are duplicates of the original parts 
furnished, and interchangeable therewith.  Furnish the following spare parts for each type and frame size of 
drawout circuit breaker, except that only one spare is required where parts are applicable to all types and frame 
sizes of the circuit breakers:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
