breaker.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One complete set of arc chute assemblies for one three pole breaker.</OLI><BRK/>
 <BRK/>
<OLI>One set of primary disconnecting devices for one three pole breaker.</OLI><BRK/>
 <BRK/>
<OLI>One set of secondary disconnecting devices for one three pole breaker.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One shunt trip coil.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One Spring-charging motor or solenoid for electrically-operated breakers.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One control relay of each type and rating for electrically-operated breakers.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One auxiliary switch complete for electrically-operated breakers.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One cell (housing) switch.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One manual operating mechanism handle for drawout feeder air circuit breakers.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Twelve fuses of each type and size for voltage transformers.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Six Indicating lamp assemblies (three red lens and three green lens.)</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Ten Indicating lamp color caps of each color.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One spring for stored-energy closing mechanism.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Four spare blank nameplates for operating unit doors.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>One lot spare bulbs for indicating lamp assemblies, package to contain not less than 20.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<OLI>One ground detection relay of each type and size used.</OLI>]<BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<OLI>One protective relay of each type and size used.</OLI>]<BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<OLI>One temperature relay of each type and size used.</OLI>]<BRK/>
<BRK/>
[<OLI>Three voltage transformer of each type and size used.</OLI>]<BRK/>
<BRK/>
